# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:18
translate italian izzy3_73d87872:

    # "I walk over to where Izzy and her crew are hanging out and see that they're passing around a couple of joints and smoking openly."
    "Mi avvicino al punto in cui si trovano Izzy e la sua banda e vedo che si stanno passando un paio di spinelli e fumano apertamente."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:19
translate italian izzy3_b4b71fa1:

    # "The whole place smells like pot as I approach."
    "Man mano che mi avvicino, tutto il posto puzza di erba."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:20
translate italian izzy3_94f16c68:

    # gl "Hey, Twig. What's up?"
    gl "Ehi, Twig. Come va?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:23
translate italian izzy3_fd07d13f:

    # gl "Well come on over, Twig. We just smokin' and chillin' you know?"
    gl "Beh, vieni qui, Twig. Stiamo solo fumando e rilassandoci, capisci?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:25
translate italian izzy3_b28ae176:

    # "Izzy looks up at me and one corner of her mouth raises slightly."
    "Izzy alza lo sguardo verso di me e un angolo della sua bocca si solleva leggermente."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:26
translate italian izzy3_a27b96dc:

    # gl "My man. Of course. You might have to contribute somethin' next time though, you know?"
    gl "Amico mio. Certo. La prossima volta però potresti dover contribuire con qualcosa, sai?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:29
translate italian izzy3_6f7d8c43:

    # "She raises an eye to me."
    "Mi lancia un'occhiata."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:30
translate italian izzy3_cccc2dda:

    # gl "Is that a problem?"
    gl "È un problema?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:31
translate italian izzy3_c60076a0:

    # pc "No, I guess not."
    pc "No, immagino di no."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:34
translate italian izzy3_1e16ba5c:

    # gl "Here. Get you some."
    gl "Tieni. Prendine un po'."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:41
translate italian smokewithizzy_24f5eb86:

    # gl "Yeah boy, get that."
    gl "Sì, ragazzo, prendilo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:42
translate italian smokewithizzy_23aac278:

    # gl "It's good shit, right?"
    gl "È roba buona, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:43
translate italian smokewithizzy_dad9e95a:

    # "I cough a bit. It's been a while since I smoked, but the quality is surprisingly good. Much better than I expected."
    "Tossisco un po’. È da un po’ che non fumo, ma la qualità è sorprendentemente buona. Molto meglio di quanto mi aspettassi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:44
translate italian smokewithizzy_f83bd81c:

    # pc "Yeah, it's good."
    pc "Sì, è buona."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:45
translate italian smokewithizzy_caf1973f:

    # gl "Damn right it is. Locally grown, you know. Best shit in the state."
    gl "Certo che lo è. Coltivata qui, sai. La roba migliore dello stato."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:48
translate italian smokewithizzy_67e03c26:

    # gl "Getting fucked up always makes me wanna get fucked, you know?"
    gl "Sballarmi mi fa sempre venire voglia di scopare, sai?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:51
translate italian smokewithizzy_ebbed377:

    # gl "I bet you could."
    gl "Scommetto che potresti."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:52
translate italian smokewithizzy_8dd9aaab:

    # gl "But Devon would get jealous."
    gl "Ma Devon diventerebbe geloso."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:54
translate italian smokewithizzy_473d2ea3:

    # gl "A boyfriend? Is this high school?"
    gl "Un ragazzo? Siamo al liceo?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:55
translate italian smokewithizzy_61c896a5:

    # gl "But yes, I'm with Devon."
    gl "Ma sì, sto con Devon."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:56
translate italian smokewithizzy_dc540ae4:

    # "She takes the joint back from me and walks over to Devon."
    "Mi riprende lo spinello e si avvicina a Devon."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:59
translate italian smokewithizzy_3ee4a4eb:

    # gl "Technically, he's my man, but we have a sort of open relationship."
    gl "Tecnicamente è il mio ragazzo, ma abbiamo una specie di relazione aperta."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:60
translate italian smokewithizzy_43279dc1:

    # gl "Where he does whatever I want and I do whoever I want."
    gl "In cui lui fa quello che voglio io e io faccio quello che voglio io."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:61
translate italian smokewithizzy_07f4d0f8:

    # gl "Ain't that right baby."
    gl "Non è vero, tesoro?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:62
translate italian smokewithizzy_818b47b0:

    # "Devon sort of shrugs, taking a deep drag of the joint she slides between his lips."
    "Devon fa una specie di scrollata di spalle, tirando una boccata profonda dallo spinello che lei gli infila tra le labbra."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:66
translate italian smokewithizzy_c9cd2780:

    # gl "No thanks?"
    gl "No, grazie?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:67
translate italian smokewithizzy_2b8b122b:

    # gl "I'm offering you free weed and you're telling me no thanks?"
    gl "Ti sto offrendo erba gratis e mi dici “no, grazie”?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:68
translate italian smokewithizzy_7f7bd852:

    # gl "You a narc or something? You a cop?"
    gl "Sei una spia o qualcosa del genere? Sei un poliziotto?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:69
translate italian smokewithizzy_1e908849:

    # pc "No, I just don't smoke."
    pc "No, è solo che non fumo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:70
translate italian smokewithizzy_8da6b61e:

    # gl "Whatever, Twig. I'm disappointed in you."
    gl "Come ti pare, Twig. Mi hai deluso."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:73
translate italian smokewithizzy_27a28c0b:

    # "She walks over to Devon and drapes herself over him, sliding the joint between his lips."
    "Si avvicina a Devon e gli si stringe addosso, infilandogli lo spinello tra le labbra."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:74
translate italian smokewithizzy_7c11b8c8:

    # gl "Get you some of that baby."
    gl "Goditelo, tesoro."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:75
translate italian smokewithizzy_6fd6eefa:

    # "He takes a deep drag and breathes it in with a sigh, a smile creeping over his face."
    "Lui tira una boccata profonda e inspira con un sospiro, mentre un sorriso gli si dipinge sul viso."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:76
translate italian smokewithizzy_dc36117b:

    # "The speaker on the table changes songs and Izzy cocks her head."
    "L’altoparlante sul tavolo cambia brano e Izzy inclina la testa."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:77
translate italian smokewithizzy_17789310:

    # gl "Man this song is bumpin! I love this shit."
    gl "Cavolo, questa canzone spacca! Adoro questa roba."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:78
translate italian smokewithizzy_f0694d16:

    # "She turns and starts dancing against Devon, who gets into it as well."
    "Si gira e inizia a ballare strusciandosi contro Devon, che si lascia coinvolgere a sua volta."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:81
translate italian smokewithizzy_c676d43f:

    # "She grinds against him, rubbing her juicy ass up and down his crotch."
    "Si struscia contro di lui, sfregando il suo culo succulento su e giù sul suo inguine."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:82
translate italian smokewithizzy_8e6bf2c6:

    # "I don't know how he can stand it. If I was him, I'd be hard as a rock right now."
    "Non so come faccia a resistere. Se fossi al suo posto, sarei duro come una roccia in questo momento."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:83
translate italian smokewithizzy_277c99a1:

    # "I mean, I kind of am just from watching it."
    "Insomma, in un certo senso lo sono già solo a guardarlo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:85
translate italian smokewithizzy_242d472b:

    # "Then there's the chirp of a siren and flashing red and blue lights as headlights illuminate the area we're standing in."
    "Poi si sente il suono di una sirena e si vedono le luci rosse e blu lampeggianti mentre i fari illuminano la zona in cui ci troviamo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:86
translate italian smokewithizzy_40384605:

    # mal "Cops!"
    mal "Poliziotti!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:87
translate italian smokewithizzy_1569f020:

    # moose "I'm out!"
    moose "Me ne vado!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:90
translate italian smokewithizzy_3068d7c7:

    # "Moose and Mal start running. Devon waits for a moment as Izzy comes up to me."
    "Moose e Mal iniziano a correre. Devon aspetta un attimo mentre Izzy mi si avvicina."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:91
translate italian smokewithizzy_4247ecf9:

    # gl "Better run, Twig!"
    gl "Meglio che scappi, Twig!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:93
translate italian smokewithizzy_a0a091ac:

    # "She's right. I didn't smoke much, but I'm feeling it. The cops would definitely notice."
    "Ha ragione. Non ho fumato molto, ma ne sento gli effetti. I poliziotti se ne accorgerebbero sicuramente."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:94
translate italian smokewithizzy_81a5df47:

    # "I should run."
    "Dovrei scappare."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:101
translate italian smokewithizzy_26da14bf:

    # pc "I'll be okay."
    pc "Andrà tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:106
translate italian izzy5run_c21257c8:

    # "I take off running, looking behind me to see the cops chasing."
    "Mi metto a correre, guardandomi alle spalle per vedere se i poliziotti mi stanno inseguendo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:107
translate italian izzy5run_fa42a946:

    # "Izzy and the rest of the gang split off in different directions, but the cops continue chasing me."
    "Izzy e il resto della banda si disperdono in direzioni diverse, ma i poliziotti continuano a inseguirmi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:108
translate italian izzy5run_dcd48c44:

    # gl "Good luck, Twig! Come back and hang out again sometime!"
    gl "Buona fortuna, Twig! Torna a trovarci qualche volta!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:109
translate italian izzy5run_c8db678c:

    # "Izzy's voice trails off as she runs off somewhere."
    "La voce di Izzy si affievolisce mentre lei scappa da qualche parte."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:110
translate italian izzy5run_b40ea09a:

    # "Fortunately the cops that pursue me aren't in the best of shape and after a bit I'm able to outrun them pretty easily."
    "Fortunatamente i poliziotti che mi inseguono non sono proprio in gran forma e dopo un po’ riesco a seminarli abbastanza facilmente."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:111
translate italian izzy5run_5e327114:

    # "It doesn't take long before they give up."
    "Non ci vuole molto prima che si arrendano."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:114
translate italian izzy5run_9f09b24a:

    # "I wait a bit, then start making my way back to my car."
    "Aspetto un po', poi inizio a tornare verso la mia auto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:115
translate italian izzy5run_1df6f5ed:

    # "What a wild night. Do they run away from the cops every single night? Seems like they should find a new place to hang out maybe?"
    "Che serata pazzesca. Scappano dalla polizia ogni singola notte? Forse dovrebbero trovarsi un nuovo posto dove passare il tempo?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:116
translate italian izzy5run_7001a3d0:

    # "Once I get to my car, I look around to make sure that the cops aren't waiting for me."
    "Una volta arrivata alla mia auto, mi guardo intorno per assicurarmi che i poliziotti non mi stiano aspettando."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:117
translate italian izzy5run_b647d708:

    # "When I'm sure that the coast is clear, I run to the car, get in, and drive away."
    "Quando sono sicuro che la costa sia libera, corro verso l’auto, salgo e me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:122
translate italian izzy5norun_deb5f235:

    # "Izzy raises her eyebrow at me and then takes off running with the rest of the gang."
    "Izzy mi lancia un’occhiata perplessa e poi si mette a correre con il resto della banda."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:125
translate italian izzy5norun_2c82fa04:

    # "I turn and start making my way back towards my car, ready to talk to the police if that's what I have to do."
    "Mi volto e inizio a tornare verso la mia auto, pronto a parlare con la polizia se è quello che devo fare."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:126
translate italian izzy5norun_21f6d686:

    # "But they don't show any interest in me, instead running past me to pursue Izzy's gang."
    "Ma loro non mostrano alcun interesse per me, anzi mi superano di corsa per inseguire la banda di Izzy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:127
translate italian izzy5norun_7bb580de:

    # "I hope they'll be okay. Do they run from the cops like this every night? Seems like they should find a new place to hang out maybe?"
    "Spero che stiano bene. Scappano dalla polizia in questo modo ogni sera? Forse dovrebbero trovarsi un nuovo posto dove passare il tempo?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy3.rpy:128
translate italian izzy5norun_cff16f53:

    # "I walk back to my car, get inside, and drive away."
    "Torno alla mia auto, salgo e me ne vado."

